cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Product Traceability or its study, please cite it as below."
title: "Product Traceability for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin that keeps a product record (requirements, decisions with rejected
  alternatives, a requirement-to-code map and a change log) with lifecycle hooks, and gives
  each new session a short summary of it. Includes a controlled A/B study on three web apps
  with the raw sessions of all 27 runs.
type: software
